    "Result": "A flying machine.Wilbur Wright and orville Wright are brothers. They like to invent things. One day they are watching some birds flying in the sky. They want to fly, too. We should invent a flying machine, says Wilbur. Great, says orville. But how? First we'll watch how the birds fly. Next, we'll draw a picture of our flying machine. Then we'll build it. Finally, we'll fly like birds.",
